<http://digistrucmed.org/normative-assertion/lu_3a3d8364f29fea972155f20a2cc2cf45ae217fa9619111a4f3a9251ad1518ef4_n0004/na_0007> <http://digistrucmed.org/notes> "Both intensity and session duration are progression targets in the initial stage." .
<http://digistrucmed.org/text-unit/lu_3a3d8364f29fea972155f20a2cc2cf45ae217fa9619111a4f3a9251ad1518ef4_n0004/tu_0019> <http://digistrucmed.org/verbatimText> "Owing to the lack of available data, the routine application of resistance training in moderate-to-high-risk cardiac patients cannot be recommended at this time and requires additional study" .
